id: H08
target: src/sello/private/sha512.nim
desc: Sha512IV table (FIPS 180-4 Sec 5.3.5, "fractional parts of the square roots of the first 8 primes") transcription error -- the first IV word's low hex nibble flipped, '0x6a09e667f3bcc908' -> '0x6a09e667f3bcc909', corrupting the initial chaining value every hash in the corpus starts from. The RFC-006 slice 4 list's named IV-word-tweak mutant.
====OLD====
    0x6a09e667f3bcc908'u64, 0xbb67ae8584caa73b'u64,
====NEW====
    0x6a09e667f3bcc909'u64, 0xbb67ae8584caa73b'u64,
====END====
